				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$${\text{L}}\left( {{\text{t}}_{0.{5}} } \right) = { 1} - {\text{L}}\left( {{\text{t}}_{0.{5}} } \right).$$\end{document}Lt0.5=1-Lt0.5.

